*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : PEN0039
*> PURPOSE : PENALTY ASSESSMENT RULES
*> AUTHOR  : J.K.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-09-11 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-12-06 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 387
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB PENNIGHT STEP070
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0039.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    *> LATE PAYMENTS IN LAST 12 MONTHS
    05 LATE-PMTS-YR       PIC 9(2).
    *> DAYS PAYMENT IS LATE
    05 DAYS-PAST-DUE      PIC 9(3).
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 ACCOUNT-STAT       PIC X VALUE 'A'.
        88 ACCOUNT-SUSPENDED VALUE 'S'.
    *> LATE PAYMENT PENALTY
    05 LATE-CHARGE        PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM REPEAT-OFFENDER
    PERFORM 4100-TO-COLLECTIONS
    DISPLAY "ACCOUNT-STAT=" ACCOUNT-STAT
    DISPLAY "LATE-CHARGE=" LATE-CHARGE
    STOP RUN.
REPEAT-OFFENDER.
    *> REPEAT LATE PAYER SUSPENSION
    IF LATE-PMTS-YR >= 5 AND DAYS-PAST-DUE > 30
        SET ACCOUNT-SUSPENDED TO TRUE
        ADD 50 TO LATE-CHARGE
    END-IF.
4100-TO-COLLECTIONS.
    *> COLLECTIONS REFERRAL
    IF DAYS-PAST-DUE > 60
        MOVE 'C' TO ACCOUNT-STAT
    END-IF.
